{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_title", "source_sha256": "ff7b143eb6e302a3c33ccb8e230852a18ee71ef85937207a55cbfae4113a9591", "ja": "観光地の誘惑", "zh": "观光景点的诱惑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c904bf2330ec943a3b3b7ed119b33884293886e5dddc2809c8a1c47410c07b5a", "ja": "ライブの後、温泉へ行く真美、未来、桃子。\n真美と未来は、温泉の他にも面白そうな\nスポットがあるとはしゃぐ。桃子はふたりを\nたしなめるが、美味しいみかんジュースが\nあると聞いて、態度を一転させるのだった。", "zh": "演出结束后，真美、未来和桃子一起前往温泉。\n真美和未来兴奋地说，除了温泉之外，还有其他看起来很有趣的景点。\n桃子劝阻着两人，但听说那里有好喝的橘子汁后，态度立刻发生了转变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "97b4373447d3c5878b766f31d2fa389c096220e9061893ea46f1dfa602fcff9e", "ja": "わ～いっ！　温泉、温泉、温泉だ～♪\nライブでかいた汗、しっかり流さなきゃ！", "zh": "哇～！温泉、温泉、温泉♪演唱会出了一身汗，得好好泡个澡冲干净才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "7b55bdc6ff60a2cdfb347317f14dd7e420b0ea196bb0531b920ecc5be8a880e0", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　真美たちを温泉につれてくるなんて、\n兄ちゃんってば、わかりやすいですなぁ。", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪居然把真美她们带到温泉来，哥哥还真是好懂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "f220a6cc0c09f58f9b76a63e9bf35052bba0ba1fae50739ed2ba3885f2089f87", "ja": "つまり、トンコツのハーブニンニクを\n期待してるんでしょ？　まさかの出会いってやつを！", "zh": "也就是说，你是在期待豚骨拉面的香草大蒜吧？期待那种意外的邂逅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "994d1023e9cd96388d3b5926f7952ffb169ba397ee20926649433f1838613cbc", "ja": "もしかして、混浴のハプニングって言いたいのか？\nここはちゃんと男女別れてるから……。", "zh": "难道你想说的是，男女混浴时发生的意外吗？这里可是男女分开的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ce14d4e62306a7408ba353497778641c9376b05998a8ff71dc55cc0bfcf7fa8b", "ja": "それに、周辺にはたくさん温泉があるみたいだし。\n浴衣でいろんな温泉を巡るのもいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "而且，附近好像有很多温泉。\n穿着浴衣去泡遍各处的温泉，应该也不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "8a1ac65468106561c2ab5530bb63e0f0bbf300d3d51587e09fbb216b4dd5ff1d", "ja": "わ～、楽しみ！　泳げるくらい\n大きな温泉もあるのかな……？", "zh": "哇～好期待！会不会有\n大到能在里面游泳的温泉呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "fb389d4852498fe04a43f5183d809b020006ce8d43365d1b946a26d4dfefc366", "ja": "みらいっち、あっちに案内板があるよ！\nレッツ調査だ～！", "zh": "未来妹，那边有导览图哦！\n出发去调查吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "5e744bf7c1fd3a60ca798bd123c039e80398487b6965b0c6ac1d396f24c22aca", "ja": "もう、未来さん、真美さん！　他のお客さんも\nいるんだから、あんまり騒いじゃダメだよ！", "zh": "真是的，未来、真美！还有其他客人在呢，\n不可以太吵哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "ea8437e9664269d493a686de2efa793a1260a07461853d2b3c22b0c43cfb17c2", "ja": "それにしても……ライブ後に温泉だなんて、\nお兄ちゃんにしては気が利いてるね♪", "zh": "不过话说回来……演出结束后泡温泉，这安排还真是体贴呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "634caf035a61d2969bc796d3cd4316b2fddb76e3d081d86e908b0440e5ea7630", "ja": "はは、気に入ってもらえてよかったよ。\n疲れを癒やして、存分にリフレッシュしてくれ。", "zh": "哈哈，你喜欢就好。泡泡温泉消除疲劳，好好放松一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "b69f21ae09b76c46cd4e43d058fc04bc47630ace27668d054266b106bbcde785", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　この近くに、\n『玉の石』っていう、願いが叶う石があるみたいです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！听说这附近有一块叫作“玉之石”、能实现愿望的石头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c5263c35a45bab222eb29376d7683b3ff448196868ba897b282e85d29662760a", "ja": "へえ、そんなのがあるのか。\nなんだか面白そうだな。", "zh": "哦，原来还有这种东西啊。\n感觉挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "98384e5bcae2e6d34b21864b964364d966e745c9713eb6d48173aee4934eab68", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃんまで……。\n桃子たちは、ゆっくり温泉に浸かりにきたんだよ？", "zh": "真是的，连大哥哥都这样……\n桃子她们可是来悠闲泡温泉的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "b7f285435a94e38c30dfb1324a37f21355408f27160351e14318aaa6f88d1324", "ja": "またまた～。叶えたい願い、渦巻く野望……\n兄ちゃんはもちろん、ももーんもあるっしょ！？", "zh": "又来了～想实现的愿望、翻涌的野心……\n老哥就不用说了，小桃子肯定也有吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "17ada10ed7a17031ca36a2c794d3b001c15078670a71271d8edaa97a73c6099f", "ja": "おいしいみかんジュースも売ってるみたいだよ？\n桃子ちゃんも、いっしょに飲もう♪", "zh": "听说那里好像还卖好喝的橘子汁哦？\n桃子也一起喝吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "aff37a1aef51a5abf999940ba071d4fc53d5cbf22d7ef99453e8174987ae1a0c", "ja": "おいしいみかんジュース……ふ、ふーん。\nそれなら桃子も、付き合ってもいいかな。", "zh": "美味的橘子汁……哼、哼。\n那样的话，桃子陪你一起去也不是不可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_area03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b9cd0d74c658a4c0d921984573d90a0f7f64537224f2152a5ea54a867773bbd1", "ja": "（みんな、まだまだ元気みたいだ。\n温泉よりも先に、まずは観光だな！）", "zh": "（大家好像还很有精神。比起泡温泉，先去观光吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
